mw2coop patch for maps/roadkill.gsc (Team Player, Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)

1. Ride end: the second player gets off too (the gunner may be player 2).
@@@ replace
	org = level.player.origin;
//	level.player FreezeControls( true );
@@@ with
	maps\_mw2coop_roadkill::ride_ends();
	org = level.player.origin;
//	level.player FreezeControls( true );
@@@ end

2. Crash: player 2 lands next to player 1.
@@@ replace
	level.player SetOrigin( player_slide_crash.origin );
@@@ with
	level.player SetOrigin( player_slide_crash.origin );
	if ( maps\_mw2coop::is_campaign_coop() )
		level.player2 thread maps\_mw2coop::teleport_to_partner_when_safe( level.player, 5 );
@@@ end

3. After the crazy ride enemies see both players again, not only player 1
   (maps\_mw2coop::players_ignoreme).
@@@ replace
	level.player.ignoreme = false;
@@@ with
	maps\_mw2coop::players_ignoreme( false );
@@@ end

4. Both players ride, so the ride's protection covers both (night audit 2026-11-17): the death shield from the start of the
   ride to the crazy ride, again for the end of the ride and four seconds after the crash; random bullets missing the
   players after the enemies retreat, at the end of the ride and at the dismount start points; the near-death vision off.
   Before, player 1 alone had them, and he may not be the gunner.
@@@ replace
	level.player EnableDeathShield( true );


	thread player_doesnt_die_in_red_flashing();
	level.player DisableWeapons();
	level.player ent_flag_clear( "near_death_vision_enabled" );
@@@ with
	foreach ( mw2coop_player in level.players )
		mw2coop_player EnableDeathShield( true );


	thread player_doesnt_die_in_red_flashing();
	level.player DisableWeapons();
	foreach ( mw2coop_player in level.players )
		mw2coop_player ent_flag_clear( "near_death_vision_enabled" );
@@@ end

   (same)
@@@ replace

	level.player EnableDeathShield( false );


	wait( 0.05 );// wait for level.lead_vehicle to get set.
@@@ with

	foreach ( mw2coop_player in level.players )
		mw2coop_player EnableDeathShield( false );


	wait( 0.05 );// wait for level.lead_vehicle to get set.
@@@ end

